span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.810" end="02:34.840"><span begin="02:31.810" end="02:32.050">Will </span><span begin="02:32.050" end="02:32.260">you </span><span begin="02:32.260" end="02:32.710">believe </span><span begin="02:32.710" end="02:32.830">me </span><span begin="02:32.830" end="02:33.040">that </span><span begin="02:33.040" end="02:33.190">I </span><span begin="02:33.190" end="02:33.640">won't </span><span begin="02:33.640" end="02:33.760">do </span><span begin="02:33.760" end="02:34.000">you </span><span begin="02:34.000" end="02:34.660">wrong</span><span begin="02:34.660" end="02:34.840">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.840" end="02:37.990"><span begin="02:34.840" end="02:35.260">That's </span><span begin="02:35.260" end="02:35.680">why </span><span begin="02:35.680" end="02:36.040">I'm </span><span begin="02:36.040" end="02:36.490">done </span><span begin="02:36.490" end="02:36.760">all </span><span begin="02:36.760" end="02:37.990">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.740" end="02:41.740"><span begin="02:38.740" end="02:39.130">By </span><span begin="02:39.130" end="02:39.760">finding </span><span begin="02:39.760" end="02:40.270">myself </span><span begin="02:40.270" end="02:40.360">I </span><span begin="02:40.360" end="02:40.690">nearly </span><span begin="02:40.690" end="02:41.020">lost </span><span begin="02:41.020" end="02:41.200">'em </span><span begin="02:41.200" end="02:41.740">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.890" end="02:44.950"><span begin="02:41.890" end="02:42.130">By </span><span begin="02:42.130" end="02:42.820">fighting </span><span begin="02:42.820" end="02:42.940">a </span><span begin="02:42.940" end="02:43.300">helper </span><span begin="02:43.300" end="02:43.330">I </span><span begin="02:43.330" end="02:43.600">thought </span><span begin="02:43.600" end="02:43.720">I </span><span begin="02:43.720" end="02:43.960">knew </span><span begin="02:43.960" end="02:44.200">it </span><span begin="02:44